28
00:02:14,911 --> 00:02:26,307
Rym: The storied tradition of "put a thing that you're desperately trying to shove into people's eyeballs on right after a thing you know those eyeballs are welcoming in" has never worked, but they always try it.

29
00:02:28,011 --> 00:02:32,868
