129
00:10:16,031 --> 00:10:24,287
Rym: Well, depends, because I do have some workflows that even when I when the original days when I got the i7 6700K, they were a hundred percent CPU bound.

130
00:10:26,452 --> 00:10:28,710
Rym: And one of those is the warp stabilizer in Premiere.

131
00:10:28,850 --> 00:10:34,490
