132
00:10:35,130 --> 00:10:36,830
Rym: So the warp stabilizer, what do we tell you?

133
00:10:36,930 --> 00:10:38,341
Scott: It's not going to save you 30 minutes.

134
00:10:38,442 --> 00:10:39,510
Scott: It's for a hundred dollars.

135
00:10:39,912 --> 00:10:40,133
Scott: Right.

136
00:10:40,174 --> 00:10:42,369
Scott: You could get a lot of stuff for a hundred dollars.

137
00:10:43,031 --> 00:10:44,334
Rym: Not in this economy.

138
00:10:44,354 --> 00:10:50,890
