147
00:11:22,491 --> 00:11:23,683
Scott: All one that you've bought.

148
00:11:23,743 --> 00:11:24,389
Scott: You didn't go wrong.

149
00:11:24,690 --> 00:11:25,293
Rym: I bought three.

