00:41:04,465 --> 00:41:06,850
Rym: I think that there's a moderate possibility of that.

615
00:41:08,830 --> 00:41:09,191
Scott: All right.

616
00:41:09,532 --> 00:41:13,358
Rym: So I went down the road of just build the same computer, but faster.

617
00:41:13,418 --> 00:41:15,161
Rym: I'm changing basically nothing in my life.

618
00:41:15,923 --> 00:41:20,090
Rym: You went down the radical approach of changing everything.

619
00:41:20,872 --> 00:41:21,393
Scott: That's right.

620
00:41:21,653 --> 00:41:27,004
